{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_024","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"BurnedNFTokens Number UInt32 No How many total of this account&#x27;s issued non-fungible tokens have been burned. This number is always equal or less than MintedNFTokens .","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":4534,"char_end":4706,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
