{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_036","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 Yes The index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":6060,"char_end":6190,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_037","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"RegularKey String AccountID No The address of a key pair that can be used to sign transactions for this account instead of the master key. Use a SetRegularKey transaction to change this value.","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":6192,"char_end":6384,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_038","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Sequence Number UInt32 Yes The sequence number of the next valid transaction for this account.","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6386,"char_end":6480,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_039","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"TicketCount Number UInt32 No How many Tickets this account owns in the ledger. This is updated automatically to ensure that the account stays within the hard limit of 250 Tickets at a time. This field is omitted if the account has zero Tickets.","location_hint":"paragraph 168","char_start":6482,"char_end":6726,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_040","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"TickSize Number UInt8 No How many significant digits to use for exchange rates of Offers involving currencies issued by this address. Valid values are 3 to 15 , inclusive.","location_hint":"paragraph 169","char_start":6728,"char_end":6899,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_041","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"TransferRate Number UInt32 No A transfer fee to charge other users for sending currency issued by this account to each other.","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":6901,"char_end":7026,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_042","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the SingleAssetVault amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":7055,"char_end":7107,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_043","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"The ID of the Vault entry associated with this account. Set during account creation; cannot be modified. If present, indicates that this is a special Vault pseudo-account AccountRoot; always omitted on non-Vault accounts.","location_hint":"paragraph 173","char_start":7109,"char_end":7330,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_044","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"WalletLocator String UInt256 No An arbitrary 256-bit value that users can set.","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":7332,"char_end":7410,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_045","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"WalletSize Number UInt32 No Unused. (The code supports this field but there is no way to set it.)","location_hint":"paragraph 175","char_start":7412,"char_end":7509,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_046","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Special AMM AccountRoot (Pseudo-Account)","location_hint":"paragraph 176","char_start":7513,"char_end":7553,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_047","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the AMM amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 177","char_start":7555,"char_end":7594,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_048","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Automated Market Makers use an AccountRoot ledger entry (pseudo-account) to issue their LP Tokens and hold the assets in the AMM pool, and an AMM ledger entry for tracking some of the details of the AMM. The address of an AMM&#x27;s AccountRoot is randomized so that users cannot identify and fund the address in advance of the AMM being created. Unlike normal accounts, AMM AccountRoot objects are created with the following settings:","location_hint":"paragraph 178","char_start":7596,"char_end":8031,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_049","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisableMaster enabled and no means of authorizing transactions. This ensures no one can control the account directly, and it cannot send transactions.","location_hint":"paragraph 179","char_start":8035,"char_end":8188,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_050","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDepositAuth enabled and no accounts preauthorized. This ensures that the only way to add money to the AMM Account is using the AMMDeposit transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 180","char_start":8190,"char_end":8344,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_051","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDefaultRipple enabled . This ensures that users can send and trade the AMM&#x27;s LP Tokens among themselves.","location_hint":"paragraph 181","char_start":8346,"char_end":8458,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_052","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"In addition, the following special rules apply to an AMM&#x27;s AccountRoot entry:","location_hint":"paragraph 182","char_start":8462,"char_end":8544,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_053","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"It is not subject to the reserve requirement . It can hold XRP only if XRP is one of the two assets in the AMM&#x27;s pool.","location_hint":"paragraph 183","char_start":8548,"char_end":8671,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_054","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"It cannot be the destination of Checks, Escrows, or Payment Channels. Any transactions that would create such entries instead fail with the result code tecNO_PERMISSION .","location_hint":"paragraph 184","char_start":8673,"char_end":8843,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_055","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Users cannot create trust lines to it for anything other than the AMM&#x27;s LP Tokens. Transactions that would create such trust lines instead fail with result code tecNO_PERMISSION . (The AMM does have two trust lines to hold the tokens in its pool, or one trust line if the other asset in its pool is XRP.)","location_hint":"paragraph 185","char_start":8845,"char_end":9154,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_056","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"If the Clawback amendment is also enabled, the issuer cannot clawback funds from an AMM.","location_hint":"paragraph 186","char_start":9156,"char_end":9244,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_057","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Other than those exceptions, these accounts are like ordinary accounts; the LP Tokens they issue behave like other tokens except that those tokens can also be used in AMM-related transactions. You can check an AMM&#x27;s balances and the history of transactions that affected it the same way you would with a regular account.","location_hint":"paragraph 187","char_start":9248,"char_end":9573,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_058","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Special Vault AccountRoot (Pseudo-Account)","location_hint":"paragraph 188","char_start":9575,"char_end":9617,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_059","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the SingleAssetVault amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 189","char_start":9619,"char_end":9671,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_060","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Vaults use an AccountRoot ledger entry (pseudo-account) to issue their shares and hold the assets deposited into the vault, and a Vault entry for tracking the vault&#x27;s configuration and state. The address of a vault&#x27;s AccountRoot is randomized so that users cannot identify and fund the address in advance of the vault being created. Unlike normal accounts, vault AccountRoot objects are created with the following settings:","location_hint":"paragraph 190","char_start":9673,"char_end":10106,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_061","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisableMaster enabled and no means of authorizing transactions. This ensures no one can control the account directly, and it cannot send transactions.","location_hint":"paragraph 191","char_start":10110,"char_end":10263,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_062","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDepositAuth enabled and no accounts pre-authorized. This ensures that the only way to add money to the vault&#x27;s AccountRoot is using the VaultDeposit transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 192","char_start":10265,"char_end":10435,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_063","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDefaultRipple enabled . This enables rippling for the vault&#x27;s pseudo-account.","location_hint":"paragraph 193","char_start":10437,"char_end":10522,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_064","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"In addition, the following special rules apply to a Vault&#x27;s AccountRoot entry:","location_hint":"paragraph 194","char_start":10526,"char_end":10609,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_065","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"The vault owner account must pay one incremental owner reserve (currently 0.2 XRP ) when creating the vault to cover the pseudo-account.","location_hint":"paragraph 195","char_start":10613,"char_end":10749,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_066","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"The Sequence number is always 0 and never changes, preventing the pseudo-account from submitting transactions.","location_hint":"paragraph 196","char_start":10751,"char_end":10861,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_067","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"A pseudo-account is automatically deleted when the vault is deleted, and cannot exist independently of a Vault entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 197","char_start":10863,"char_end":10980,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_068","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Many AccountRoot flags correspond to options you can change with an AccountSet transaction . However, the bit values used in the ledger are different than the values used to enable or disable those flags in a transaction. Ledger flags have names that begin with lsf .","location_hint":"paragraph 199","char_start":11003,"char_end":11270,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_069","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"AccountRoot objects can have the following flags combined in the Flags field:","location_hint":"paragraph 200","char_start":11272,"char_end":11349,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_070","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Corresponding AccountSet Flag Description","location_hint":"paragraph 201","char_start":11353,"char_end":11428,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_071","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfAllowTrustLineClawback 0x80000000 2147483648 asfAllowTrustLineClawback Enable Clawback for this account.","location_hint":"paragraph 202","char_start":11432,"char_end":11539,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_072","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the Clawback amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 203","char_start":11541,"char_end":11585,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_073","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfAllowTrustLineLocking 0x40000000 1073741824 asfAllowTrustLineLocking Enable Escrow for Trust Line Tokens issued by this account.","location_hint":"paragraph 204","char_start":11589,"char_end":11720,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_074","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the TokenEscrow amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 205","char_start":11722,"char_end":11769,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_075","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDefaultRipple 0x00800000 8388608 asfDefaultRipple Enable rippling on this addresses&#x27;s trust lines by default. Required for issuing addresses; discouraged for others.","location_hint":"paragraph 206","char_start":11773,"char_end":11946,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_076","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDepositAuth 0x01000000 16777216 asfDepositAuth This account has DepositAuth enabled, meaning it can only receive funds from transactions it sends, and from preauthorized accounts.","location_hint":"paragraph 207","char_start":11948,"char_end":12130,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_077","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the DepositAuth amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 208","char_start":12132,"char_end":12179,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_078","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisableMaster 0x00100000 1048576 asfDisableMaster Disallows use of the master key to sign transactions for this account.","location_hint":"paragraph 209","char_start":12183,"char_end":12306,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_079","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisallowIncomingCheck 0x08000000 134217728 asfDisallowIncomingCheck This account blocks incoming Checks.","location_hint":"paragraph 210","char_start":12308,"char_end":12415,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_080","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 211","char_start":12417,"char_end":12469,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_081","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisallowIncomingNFTokenOffer 0x04000000 67108864 asfDisallowIncomingNFTokenOffer This account blocks incoming NFTokenOffers.","location_hint":"paragraph 212","char_start":12473,"char_end":12600,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_082","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"Requires the DisallowIncoming amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 213","char_start":12602,"char_end":12654,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_083","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisallowIncomingPayChan 0x10000000 268435456 asfDisallowIncomingPayChan This account blocks incoming Payment Channels.","location_hint":"paragraph 214","char_start":12658,"char_end":12779,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
