{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_087","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfDisallowXRP 0x00080000 524288 asfDisallowXRP Client applications should not send XRP to this account. (Advisory; not enforced by the protocol.)","location_hint":"paragraph 218","char_start":13015,"char_end":13161,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_088","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfGlobalFreeze 0x00400000 4194304 asfGlobalFreeze All assets issued by this account are frozen.","location_hint":"paragraph 219","char_start":13163,"char_end":13259,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_089","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfNoFreeze 0x00200000 2097152 asfNoFreeze This account cannot freeze trust lines connected to it. Once enabled, cannot be disabled.","location_hint":"paragraph 220","char_start":13261,"char_end":13393,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_090","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfPasswordSpent 0x00010000 65536 (None) This account has used its free SetRegularKey transaction.","location_hint":"paragraph 221","char_start":13395,"char_end":13493,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_091","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfRequireAuth 0x00040000 262144 asfRequireAuth This account must individually approve other users for those users to hold this account&#x27;s tokens.","location_hint":"paragraph 222","char_start":13495,"char_end":13645,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_092","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"lsfRequireDestTag 0x00020000 131072 asfRequireDest Requires incoming payments to specify a Destination Tag.","location_hint":"paragraph 223","char_start":13647,"char_end":13754,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_093","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"The reserve for an AccountRoot entry is the base reserve, currently 1 XRP , except in the case of a special AMM or Vault AccountRoot.","location_hint":"paragraph 225","char_start":13779,"char_end":13912,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_094","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"This XRP cannot be sent to others but it can be burned as part of the transaction cost .","location_hint":"paragraph 226","char_start":13914,"char_end":14002,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_9505395adfe8_095","source_id":"src_9505395adfe8","source_hash":"1053fd845d47dccfbc7e9acd815c62f9ff4cd1ab9094c995aaebaa72f01294c3","text":"The ID of an AccountRoot entry is the SHA-512Half of the following values, concatenated in order:","location_hint":"paragraph 228","char_start":14027,"char_end":14124,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:18:13.791Z"}
